# Rattlechains: on turn 2 Bot2 casts a Spirit of the Labyrinth and Bot1 flashes in Rattlechains, whose enters trigger
# targets Bot2's Spirit (an opponent's Spirit is accepted: it has hexproof; CR 702.11b,
# 611.2a). With Rattlechains out Bot1 may then cast its own Spirit of the Labyrinth in Bot2's turn (CR 601.3b, 702.8a) but
# not the Ornithopter, which is no Spirit. On turn 3 Bot2, who controls no Rattlechains, cannot cast its second Spirit
# in Bot1's turn.

